    "notes": "Three sessions at Van Gelder Studio, Hackensack: Oct 9 (Ba-Lue/Pannonica), Oct 15 (title track, edited from multiple takes), Dec 7 (I Surrender Dear/Bemsha Swing). Wikipedia lists 'I Surrender, Dear' as solo piano; AllMusic lists recording Dec 17-23, 1956 but Wikipedia's per-session dates are more precise and used here. Discogs credits engineer Jack Higgins; AllMusic does not list engineer."
